#
# Fallback for a builder that does not read server/rust-reference/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# (a builder without BuildKit): the same allow list. The build context of the reference
# image is the repository root (DL-095).
*
!server/rust-reference/
!tools/rqp-markup/rust/
**/target
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/mutants.out*
**/.stryker-tmp
**/reports
